    "$t": "台文通訊BONG報350期-編輯室ê話"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">5--月ê主角是阿母。Tī lín兜，洗衫、曝衫是siáng ê khang-khuè？〈曝衫〉是按怎hōo衫仔褲自由tháu放thang跳舞？「料理」tiānn-tiānn是kap阿母sio牽連做伙ê主題，〈阿母ê飯湯〉hōo人kan-na讀就腹肚iau，你上愛食阿母ê啥mih料理？〈走揣懷念ê食堂氣味〉透過戲齣內底ê逐出菜，kā bat拍m̄見ê親情、愛情甚至祖孫仔ê記憶，lóng沓沓仔揣倒tńg--來。Lín兜kám mā有kap厝--裡貓仔愈飼感情愈好ê阿母？貓仔〈偷走厝〉是發生啥mih代誌？Beh飼動物伴就ài kā顧kā疼，動物ê權利是現代人愈來愈重視ê議題，〈動物伴ê新世代〉hōo逐家做伙對tsit項代誌有進一步ê了解。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgwEnK84BgrYRPouvFQxxmAk7SStchqOG6TVkVdxjcTIRqK7TrpANSyMXe_I84uRuUZiU0albtzIdb_R1Aysx_atND072nYKnEDjLXtYQgUuczRdYwPkBNnXV-EhhsZnRqSqGXFCZWFD1qU/s3036/%25E5%258F%25B0%25E6%2596%2587%25E9%2580%259A%25E8%25A8%258ABONG%25E5%25A0%25B1350%25E6%259C%259F_%25E7%25B7%25A8%25E8%25BC%25AF.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgwEnK84BgrYRPouvFQxxmAk7SStchqOG6TVkVdxjcTIRqK7TrpANSyMXe_I84uRuUZiU0albtzIdb_R1Aysx_atND072nYKnEDjLXtYQgUuczRdYwPkBNnXV-EhhsZnRqSqGXFCZWFD1qU/w454-h640/%25E5%258F%25B0%25E6%2596%2587%25E9%2580%259A%25E8%25A8%258ABONG%25E5%25A0%25B1350%25E6%259C%259F_%25E7%25B7%25A8%25E8%25BC%25AF.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEju2x3BhIr3jVjmYPnWCpxaUJtiPSdyaq0OfOFqACnHGFFaVtMyIObTrA0kiSbnnviAx3EBfPuV1VcEob_8Xfy-OmoN_jd0mH-NbXbeHElNkdkHyL7AdqmVgpduIfl5lBCeLAGcEqOeDKphVJhMk7M0zbOF2A7kYWRqgnWcji5sud8V3FayT9bNkqFSog/s1424/350%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\